          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Pressure management with 3-layer technology</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The 3-layer air-channeling technology creates interlocking air cells to immerse and envelop the patient. The 3-layer design provides air support helping prevent the patient from bottoming out because the patient is supported by a pocket of air.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Feb 22 2024 14:35:15 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
